From 6aa4813ce74551a8128ff35998166bff5678389a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ajensenwaud <ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 07:42:35 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 03/29] inkling2: Mini's config, visit plan and loop tensors

config.zig accepts inkling2_loop with its loop_config (fixed passes only,
a core that opens a residual block, gate rank 64) and checks drafter taps
against visits rather than layers. visits.zig lays out the 48 visits:
layer, pass, cache slot as transformers numbers them, messages, restarts
and the bank of the previous pass. names.zig adds the cross-pass query
tables and the four gates on each core layer; the published header now
checks clean against the map. Small's tests are unchanged.
---
